— balance sheet total: EUR 20 000 000 
— net turnover: EUR 40 000 000 
— own funds: EUR 2 000 000 
(3) National and regional governments, including public bodies that manage public debt at national or regional level, 
Central Banks, international and supranational institutions such as the World Bank, the IMF, the ECB, the EIB and 
other similar international organisations.

